# Dual-game changes (default)

This app has two top-level game tabs: **Path of Exile 2** (`poe2`) and **Path of Exile** (`poe`), configured in `GAME_CONFIGS` in `app.js`.

When working on a change, apply it for **both** games by default.

- Prefer shared logic over game-specific forks.
- If behavior depends on game, handle both `poe` and `poe2`—do not ship a one-tab-only fix.
- After UI, filter, storage, styling, or data-loading changes, verify both game tabs.
- Single-game work is allowed only for inherently game-specific features (e.g. Campaign / `data-poe2-only`) or when the user explicitly scopes to one game.

Also follow root `AGENTS.md` for Codex and shared agent guidance.
